Shared headers, visible to every app (platformio.ini adds -I include).

  board_config.h   Board revision, brightness, IMU thresholds, rotation
                   offset. Describes the HARDWARE, so it is shared by all
                   apps. Anything describing a single app belongs in that
                   app's app_config.h instead.

  pin_config.h     Pin map: QSPI display, I2C, I2S audio, SD.

  lv_conf.h        LVGL configuration. Unused at present -- no app currently
                   pulls LVGL in, so it is not compiled.

See ../docs/HARDWARE.md for what this board actually is.
